pipewire-network-sender (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewritten in C using libpipewire-0.3 native API
  * JSON configuration via libjson-c
  * Supervisor process with per-stream retry logic
  * pipewire-network-rtp-sender: low-level RTP null-sink sender
  * pipewire-network-sender-config: shell-based config management tool
  * Systemd user service template support

